  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Throne in Heaven",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this I looked, and there before me was a door standing open in heaven. And the voice I had first heard speaking to me like a trumpet said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Come up here, and I will show you what must take place after this.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "REV.4.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "REV.4.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At once I was in the Spirit, and there before me was a throne in heaven with someone sitting on it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the one who sat there had the appearance of jasper and ruby. A rainbow that shone like an emerald encircled the throne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surrounding the throne were twenty-four other thrones, and seated on them were twenty-four elders. They were dressed in white and had crowns of gold on their heads.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the throne came flashes of lightning, rumblings and peals of thunder. In front of the throne, seven lamps were blazing. These are the seven spirits",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also in front of the throne there was what looked like a sea of glass, clear as crystal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "REV 4:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "In the center, around the throne, were four living creatures, and they were covered with eyes, in front and in back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The first living creature was like a lion, the second was like an ox, the third had a face like a man, the fourth was like a flying eagle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Each of the four living creatures had six wings and was covered with eyes all around, even under its wings. Day and night they never stop saying:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "qc",
        "vid": "REV 4:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'Holy, holy, holy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "qc",
        "vid": "REV 4:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "is the Lord God Almighty,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "qc",
        "vid": "REV 4:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who was, and is, and is to come.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever the living creatures give glory, honor and thanks to him who sits on the throne and who lives for ever and ever,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the twenty-four elders fall down before him who sits on the throne and worship him who lives for ever and ever. They lay their crowns before the throne and say:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You are worthy, our Lord and God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 4:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to receive glory and honor and power,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 4:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for you created all things,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 4:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and by your will they were created",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 4:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and have their being.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
